    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death is inevitable.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash your way through the different hellishly difficult  areas, while assisting Death with getting his subjects under control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're going to die. A lot.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working as a subject of Death, it's inevitable. Learn and master the mechanics of the ghoulish dash to overcome the difficulty and die less.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience Hell</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death will need your help in all areas of Hell, so you'll see everything from the Tree Tops to the Barracks, and with true skill, maybe even Ascension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Death's List</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death works in his mysterious ways, and for some reason he needs you to fulfil very specific requirements for each level, awarding you with game-altering sigils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alter the Rules</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death's Sigils will change the game's fundamental rules, creating a completely new challenge to dive into.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death is inevitable.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash your way through the different hellishly difficult  areas, while assisting Death with getting his subjects under control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're going to die. A lot.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working as a subject of Death, it's inevitable. Learn and master the mechanics of the ghoulish dash to overcome the difficulty and die less.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience Hell</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death will need your help in all areas of Hell, so you'll see everything from the Tree Tops to the Barracks, and with true skill, maybe even Ascension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Death's List</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death works in his mysterious ways, and for some reason he needs you to fulfil very specific requirements for each level, awarding you with game-altering sigils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alter the Rules</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death's Sigils will change the game's fundamental rules, creating a completely new challenge to dive into.</p>",
